This directory includes OpenWrt packages.

morse_driver - kernel module
morse-fw - firmware for chips (required for kernel module to load)
mm-board-config - provides standard BCF files (a BCF/board configuration file for the board/module you're using is required)

morse_cli - lower level interaction with chip; can be shipped on end user devices
morsectrl - development access to chip (superset of morse_cli)

hostapd_s1g - customised hostapd for s1g support
wpa_supplicant_s1g - customised wpa_supplicant for s1g support

netifd-morse - plugin for netifd to add support for `type morse` (incl hotplug)
morse-regdb - CSV of S1G frequencies (used by netifd-morse)
